Z||000001||Slammed Fiero||06-27-2001||09:37 AM||||I have no problem with it , your entitled to your own thoughts. I just think it's a narrow minded misguided view.<P>Ricer refers basically to the So.Cal culture. But not all jap car drivers are ricers. My neighbour who has a S2000 with a greddy turbo kit in the works , 19" HRE wheels would not be considered a ricer. His son with an 85 civic 1500S with 8 million decals , chopped springs , brospeed exhaust , 2 x 12" subs and a bone stock motor , would be considered a ricer.<P>I have lots of friends into import performance, there just as passionate as we are about are cars , and I hate to say it , for every fast fiero out there , there are quite a few more fast civics and imports.<P>Just my personal thoughts.<P>JM<P>try <A HREF="http://www.riceboypage.com" TARGET=_blank>www.riceboypage.com</A>  for some laughfs and insite intot he wide world of real RICERS.||||reg||1
